<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
<meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache">
<meta http-equiv="Expires" content="0">
<meta name="vo-seal-build" content="1.12.2-20261011-page-verified-contradictions">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://verumglobal.foundation/seal-document.html">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="/images/favicon.png">
<title>Seal Document — Verum Omnis</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    background: #040D1B;
    color: #D5D8DD;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }

  /* Nav bar matching main site */
  .topnav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(4, 13, 27, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    height: 64px;
  }
  .topnav-inner {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; height: 100%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }
  .topnav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; text-decoration: none; }
  .topnav-logo img { height: 40px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  .topnav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
  .topnav-links a {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #4A7EC7; text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .topnav-links a:hover { color: #F8F9FA; }
  .topnav-links a.active { color: #D4A843; }
  .topnav-cta {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .topnav-cta a {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .cta-outline {
    padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #4A7EC7; color: #4A7EC7;
  }
  .cta-outline:hover { border-color: #D4A843; color: #D4A843; }
  .cta-gold {
    padding: 10px 20px; background: #D4A843; color: #040D1B;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cta-gold:hover { background: #E8C567; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .topnav-links, .topnav-cta { display: none; }
  }

  /* Prominent Law Enforcement Banner */
  .le-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(74, 126, 199, 0.15), rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.1));
    border: 2px solid #4A7EC7;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(74, 126, 199, 0.15);
  }
  .le-banner-title {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: #22c55e;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .le-banner-subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #D5D8DD;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .le-banner-subtitle strong {
    color: #F8F9FA;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Header */
  .header { text-align: center; margin: 80px 0 40px; }
  .header .logo-main {
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    max-width: min(360px, 70vw); height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(74, 126, 199, 0.2));
  }
  .header .label {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .header h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300; color: #F8F9FA;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .header p {
    font-size: 1.125rem; color: #D5D8DD;
    margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Upload Area */
  .upload-zone {
    border: 2px dashed #1A2E52; border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease; background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.08);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .upload-zone:hover { border-color: #D4A843; background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.2); }
  .upload-zone.dragover { border-color: #D4A843; background: rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.08); }
  .upload-zone .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .upload-zone h3 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 24px; color: #F8F9FA; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 400;
  }
  .upload-zone p { font-size: 14px; color: #4A7EC7; }
  .upload-zone input[type="file"] { display: none; }

  .file-info { display: none; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.12); border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
  }
  .file-info.visible { display: block; }

  /* Seal Type Toggle */
  .seal-type { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px; justify-content: center; }
  .seal-type button {
    padding: 14px 32px; border: 1px solid #1A2E52; border-radius: 10px;
    background: transparent; color: #4A7EC7; font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .seal-type button.active { border-color: #D4A843; background: rgba(212,168,67,0.1); color: #D4A843; }
  .seal-type button:hover:not(.active) { border-color: #4A7EC7; color: #F8F9FA; }

  .client-field { display: none; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .client-field.visible { display: block; }
  .client-field label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: #4A7EC7; margin-bottom: 8px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 11px; }
  .client-field input {
    width: 100%; padding: 14px 18px; border: 1px solid #1A2E52; border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.15); color: #F8F9FA; font-size: 15px; font-family: inherit;
  }
  .client-field input:focus { outline: none; border-color: #D4A843; }
  .client-field input::placeholder { color: #4A7EC7; opacity: 0.6; }

  .seal-btn {
    width: 100%; padding: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843 0%, #b8942a 100%);
    color: #040D1B; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease; font-family: inherit;
    margin-bottom: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .seal-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }
  .seal-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

  /* Pipeline */
  .pipeline { display: none; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .pipeline.visible { display: block; }
  .pipeline h3 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 20px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 400;
  }
  .step {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .step .status {
    width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .step .status.pending { border: 2px solid #1A2E52; color: #4A7EC7; }
  .step .status.processing { border: 2px solid #D4A843; color: #D4A843; animation: pulse 1.5s infinite; }
  .step .status.complete { background: #22c55e; border: 2px solid #22c55e; color: #040D1B; }
  .step .status.error { background: #ef4444; border: 2px solid #ef4444; color: #fff; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.5; } }
  .step .label { color: #D5D8DD; }
  .step .label strong { color: #F8F9FA; }
  .step .detail { margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; color: #4A7EC7;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; max-width: 220px;
    overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Results */
  .results { display: none; background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px;
  }
  .results.visible { display: block; }
  .results h3 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 24px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 400;
  }
  .hash-row { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .hash-row label { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #4A7EC7; margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  }
  .hash-display {
    background: rgba(4, 13, 27, 0.6); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #22c55e;
    word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
  }
  .qr-section { text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; }
  #qrPreview { max-width: 200px; border-radius: 12px; background: white; padding: 16px; }
  .qr-section p { font-size: 12px; color: #4A7EC7; margin-top: 10px; }

  .mode-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .mode-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .mode-card {
    text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
    background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; transition: all 0.25s;
  }
  .mode-card strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: #F8F9FA; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .mode-card span { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; }
  .mode-card.active { border-color: #D4A843; background: rgba(212,168,67,0.08); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #D4A843 inset; }
  .mode-card.active strong { color: #D4A843; }

  .ots-status {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .ots-status.pending { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.25); color: #D4A843; }
  .ots-status.complete { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.25); color: #22c55e; }
  .ots-status.error { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25); color: #ef4444; }

  .preview-section { margin: 20px 0; padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(4, 13, 27, 0.4); border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
  }
  .preview-section h4 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 18px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 400;
  }
  .preview-section p { font-size: 13px; color: #D5D8DD; line-height: 1.7; }
  .preview-section p strong { color: #F8F9FA; }

  .verify-link {
    display: block; text-align: center; padding: 14px;
    background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.15); border-radius: 10px;
    color: #D4A843; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .verify-link:hover { background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.3); border-color: #D4A843; }

  .download-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .download-btn {
    display: block; padding: 16px; border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s ease; cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid #D4A843; background: rgba(212,168,67,0.08);
    color: #D4A843;
  }
  .download-btn:hover { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.15); }
  .download-btn.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843 0%, #b8942a 100%);
    color: #040D1B; border: none;
  }
  .download-btn.primary:hover { background: #E8C567; }

  /* Info Section */
  .info-section { margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
  }
  .info-section h3 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 400;
  }
  .info-section > p { font-size: 16px; color: #D5D8DD; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .info-section .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .info-section .grid .item {
    background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.08); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.4);
  }
  .info-section .grid .item h4 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 18px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .info-section .grid .item p { font-size: 13px; color: #4A7EC7; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }

  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(26, 46, 82, 0.5);
    text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #4A7EC7;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; line-height: 2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .info-section .grid, .download-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Top Navigation -->
<nav class="topnav">
  <div class="topnav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="topnav-logo">
      <img src="/images/logo-full.png" alt="Verum Omnis">
    </a>
    <div class="topnav-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/seal-document.html" class="active">Seal</a>
      <a href="/documents-resources.html">Documents</a>
      <a href="/verify.html">Verify</a>
      <a href="/constitution.html">Constitution</a>
      <a href="/verify-data.html">Report</a>
      <a href="/dashboard.html">Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">

  <!-- Header with logo -->
  <div class="header">
    <img src="/images/logo-full.png" alt="Verum Omnis" class="logo-main">
    <div class="label">AI FORENSICS FOR TRUTH — CLIENT-SIDE — NOTHING LEAVES YOUR DEVICE</div>
    <h1>Document Sealing Service</h1>
    <p>Apply a forensic-grade cryptographic seal with A4 watermark, clean QR code, SHA-512 fingerprint, identity verification, GPS/device tracking, optional password protection, and Bitcoin blockchain anchoring via OpenTimestamps.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Prominent Law Enforcement Banner -->
  <div class="le-banner">
    <div class="le-banner-title">✓ FREE FOR LAW ENFORCEMENT &amp; PRIVATE CITIZENS</div>
    <div class="le-banner-subtitle"><strong>Secure document sealing with forensic verification</strong> — powered by Verum Omnis cryptographic platform. Commercial sealing requires licensing.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Upload Area -->
  <div class="upload-zone" id="uploadZone">
    <div class="icon">&#128196;</div>
    <h3>Upload PDF Document(s) — sealed as one</h3>
    <p>Drag and drop <strong>up to 10 PDFs or photos (JPG/PNG)</strong> here, or click to browse (hold Ctrl/Cmd to pick several). Each photo is placed on its own PDF page on this device. Multiple documents are <strong>merged and sealed as ONE</strong> — you get back a single sealed document and a single seal certificate.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:8px;"><strong>Voice notes:</strong> pick the recordings (.opus) with any screen grabs of them — or upload a <strong>WhatsApp chat export (.zip)</strong>: on your phone open the chat → ⋮ → More → Export chat → <em>Include media</em>. The archive is unpacked <strong>on this device, never uploaded</strong>; every voice note, image and the chat text seal together and the report ties each note to its sender and time.</p>
    <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept=".pdf,application/pdf,.opus,.ogg,.oga,.m4a,.aac,.mp3,.wav,.amr,.3gp,audio/*,.txt,text/plain,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,image/png,image/jpeg,.mp4,.mov,.m4v,.webm,.mkv,.avi,video/*,.zip,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed" multiple>
  </div>

  <!-- File Info -->
  <div class="file-info" id="fileInfo">
    <span style="color:#D4A843;">&#128206;</span> <span id="fileName" style="color:#F8F9FA;"></span>
    <span id="fileSize" style="color:#4A7EC7; margin-left:10px;"></span>
    <div id="fileList" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.7;"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="zipNote" style="display:none;margin:0 0 14px;background:rgba(74,126,199,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(74,126,199,0.35);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.6;"></div>
  <div id="protectedNote" style="display:none;margin:0 0 20px;background:rgba(212,168,67,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.3);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;font-size:13px;color:#D4A843;line-height:1.6;">&#128274; <strong>This PDF is password-protected.</strong> It can still be sealed — the seal (SHA-512 fingerprint + blockchain timestamp) will cover these exact bytes, and remains fully verifiable. But the watermark, QR code and footer cannot be stamped inside a locked file, so they will appear on your Seal Certificate instead of on the document pages. If you want a stamped copy, remove the password first (e.g. print the PDF to a new PDF), then seal that.</div>

  <!-- Seal Type Toggle -->
  <div class="seal-type">
    <button class="active" data-type="private" onclick="setSealType('private')">&#127968; Private (Free)</button>
    <button data-type="commercial" onclick="setSealType('commercial')">&#127970; Commercial</button>
  </div>

  <!-- Sealing Mode: tamper protection only (default) vs tamper protection + forensic analysis -->
  <div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:10px;">Sealing Mode</label>
    <div class="mode-grid">
      <button type="button" class="mode-card active" id="modeSealOnly" onclick="setSealMode('seal-only')">
        <strong>&#128737; Seal document <span style="font-size:10px;color:#4A7EC7;font-weight:400;">(default)</span></strong>
        <span>Cryptographic seal + Bitcoin blockchain timestamp only. No content is analysed and nothing leaves this device. You receive the sealed PDF and a one-page Seal Certificate. Choose this for privileged or sensitive matters.</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="mode-card" id="modeForensic" onclick="setSealMode('forensic')">
        <strong>&#128270; Seal document with forensic report</strong>
        <span>Everything in Seal document, plus the on-device forensic scan (anchored findings, stated as fact), the AI review, the Brain 9 sweep of the sealed text, transcription of voice notes, and two sealed reports: the technical forensic report and the court-ready narrative. For the AI steps, finding metadata, bounded sealed page text, the findings JSON, bounded technical-report text and voice-note audio leave this device to Cloudflare Workers AI; nothing is stored there.</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sender Identity (optional, for affidavit pre-fill) -->
  <div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <button type="button" onclick="toggleSection('identitySection')" style="background:none;border:none;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;cursor:pointer;padding:0;">&#128100; + Add Sender Identity (optional — for affidavit pre-fill, chain of custody)</button>
    <div id="identitySection" style="display:none;margin-top:16px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(26,46,82,0.5);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;">
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6;">Identity details appear only in your private Seal Certificate — never in the public QR code.</p>
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Full Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="senderName" placeholder="e.g., John van der Merwe" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-family:inherit;">
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">ID / Passport Number</label>
      <input type="text" id="senderID" placeholder="e.g., 760101 1234 087" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-family:inherit;">
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Physical Address</label>
      <input type="text" id="senderAddress" placeholder="e.g., 12 Main Street, Sandton, Johannesburg" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-family:inherit;">
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Contact Email</label>
      <input type="email" id="senderEmail" placeholder="e.g., john@email.com" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;">
      <label style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.6;margin-top:14px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="includeIdentityInQr" style="width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#D4A843;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
        <span>Include identity + GPS in the public QR code (opt-in, default off). <strong style="color:#D4A843;">Warning: anyone holding the sealed document can read the QR payload.</strong> Leave unchecked to keep identity and GPS only in your private Seal Certificate.</span>
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Password Protection -->
  <div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;color:#D5D8DD;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="passwordToggle" onchange="toggleSection('passwordField')" style="width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#D4A843;">
      &#128274; Password protect this document (delivery receipt mode)
    </label>
    <div id="passwordField" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;">
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.5;">The recipient must contact you to request the password before they can open the document. You will know they received it and opened it. This is your delivery receipt.</p>
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Document Password</label>
      <input type="password" id="docPassword" placeholder="Min 8 characters" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;font-family:inherit;">
      <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Confirm Password</label>
      <input type="password" id="docPasswordConfirm" placeholder="Re-enter password" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Anonymous pattern sharing — automatic in forensic mode (founder direction 2026-09-07:
