  <div id="patternShareSection" style="margin-bottom:24px;display:none;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.6;">
      <span style="flex-shrink:0;">&#128202;</span>
      <span>The engine improves as it is used: after each forensic report, anonymous pattern data — detector ids, contradiction types, severities and page counts, never document content, names or quotes — is shared with the rules service, and signed rule packages come back to every client.</span>
    </div>
    <div id="rulePackageStatus" style="font-size:12px;color:#8A93A0;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px;padding-left:28px;">Rule package: checking the rules service…</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Forensic-report disclosure — forensic mode only. No switches: choosing "Seal document with forensic report" IS the choice. -->
  <div id="aiReviewSection" style="margin-bottom:24px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(26,46,82,0.5);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;display:none;">
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;">&#129302; <strong style="color:#F8F9FA;">What "Seal document with forensic report" does.</strong> Your document is analysed entirely on this device, in your browser, by the deterministic engine; its findings are stated as fact and anchored to quoted text on cited pages. Then the AI review runs on Cloudflare Workers AI: a short excerpt is classified for context, the findings are assessed before the report is built, <strong style="color:#F8F9FA;">Brain 9 reads the sealed page text</strong> (up to 16 windows of about 11,000 characters, pages without findings first) for anything the engine missed — every suggestion must quote the text verbatim or it is discarded — and the court-ready narrative is written section by section beside the technical report from the sealed page text, the findings JSON and the sealed technical report. The engine is the first extractor, not the limit of the narrative: a contradiction the engine missed can print only when both quoted sides verify against the cited sealed pages. Large bundles are supplied in a bounded, declared page set; the printed provenance states exactly what the narrator received. Brain 9 recommendations are shown here and held outside the sealed reports; the verdict on any person is for the court.</p>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;"><strong style="color:#F8F9FA;">What leaves this device for those steps:</strong> finding metadata — the type, severity and a short quote for each finding — plus bounded text context (up to 4,000 characters from the first pages for classification, up to 24,000 characters around each narrative section's findings, up to 64,000 characters of page-tagged sealed bundle text, the findings JSON up to 32,000 characters, the technical report text up to 32,000 characters, and the sealed page text in windows of about 11,000 characters for the Brain 9 sweep); voice-note audio for transcription. Nothing is stored server-side; GPS, device and sealer identity are never sent. For privileged or sensitive matters choose <strong style="color:#F8F9FA;">Seal document</strong> instead: nothing leaves the device.</p>
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">I am sealing as (optional)</label>
    <select id="tierSelector" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;">
      <option value="">Prefer not to say</option>
      <option value="private">Private citizen</option>
      <option value="law_enforcement">Law enforcement</option>
      <option value="commercial">Commercial</option>
    </select>
    <div id="gatekeepBanner" style="display:none;margin-top:14px;background:rgba(212,168,67,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.3);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;font-size:13px;color:#D4A843;line-height:1.6;">&#9888; This platform is free for private citizens and law enforcement. Commercial use requires a licence — see <a href="/constitution.html" style="color:#D4A843;text-decoration:underline;">verumglobal.foundation/constitution.html</a>.</div>
  </div>

