    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#D5D8DD;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;">&#128196; <strong style="color:#F8F9FA;">Case details (optional).</strong> Anything you enter here is printed on the forensic report cover — like a case file. Leave blank and the report simply uses the document name.</p>
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Case name</label>
    <input type="text" id="caseNameInput" placeholder="e.g., Greensky Ornamentals FZ-LLC — Shareholder Oppression Investigation" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Case reference(s)</label>
    <input type="text" id="caseRefsInput" placeholder="e.g., RAKEZ Case #1295911  |  SAPS CAS 126/4/2025" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Parties</label>
    <input type="text" id="casePartiesInput" placeholder="e.g., Complainant: L. Highcock  |  Respondents: M. Nortje, K. Lappeman" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:#4A7EC7;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;">Jurisdiction</label>
    <input type="text" id="caseJurisdictionInput" placeholder="e.g., United Arab Emirates (RAKEZ) &amp; South Africa" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #1A2E52;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(15,52,96,0.15);color:#F8F9FA;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;">
  </div>

  <!-- Client Name (commercial only) -->
